<title>USA: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 13-7/8 in New York.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 13-7/8 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper closed at 13-7/8 in New York on Thursday. It recorded the day's low of 13-1/2 and the day's high of 13-7/8.</p>
<p>Volume was 64,100 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 21,600. Its previous close on Wednesday was 13-1/2.</p>
<p>One ADS represents four common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
